+ * 9 synthetic manual-shot target, 2 story ownership, 1 unconfigured Scene.
+ * Additional assertions cover malformed options, unavailable/zero canvas and
+ * authoring validation. Canvas/DOM are doubles; this is not event observation,
+ * browser input, real candidate-art QA, combat or mission completion proof. */
